# yq1 -- reading one field
#
# yq (mikefarah/yq, itself written in Go) is jq for YAML. The expression in
# this file is run as:
#
#   yq --from-file query.yq deployment.yaml
#
# Lines starting with `#` are comments; everything else is the expression.
#
# Task: print the image of the *first* container of the Deployment, i.e.
#   ghcr.io/acme/api:1.4.2
#
# The expression below was copied from a Pod query and prints `null`.
# A Deployment wraps its Pod spec in a template. Try it yourself:
#   yq --from-file query.yq deployment.yaml
#

.spec.containers[0].image
